        "question_id": "q-134231",
        "problem": "Matt and Andrea each bought $6$ ounces of salted peanuts and $4$ ounces of unsalted peanuts. In total, they bought$\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,$ounces of peanuts.",
